   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity Development of Municipal Associations    CDMA - AMCs FBiH</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of the project is to strengthen and further institutionalize the AMCs in BIH and to help develop strategic documents and services. The project should enhance the AMCs&apos; capacities to act as democratic, legitimate, transparent, effective and sustainable institutions that  will serve as a service-provider to their members and strengthen the  influence of municipalities on higher levels of government.</narrative>
